1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:06,500
Nature speaks in waves. We translate it.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,400
You can't see the air. But you can understand it.

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,600
CHAAK reads the wind, the rain and the sun…

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,800
…and SMAA wakes up…

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,200
…to breathe the air.

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,800
Inside, every part has a job.

7
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,200
A laser counts every particle that crosses its beam.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:40,600
Gases flow into the electrodes, react and become current.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,400
Engineered in Mexico, piece by piece.

10
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:55,000
Every pulse becomes a measurement, and every measurement, open data.

11
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:01,000
…in your city, in real time.

12
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:09,200
That's how it reaches AIreGPT, so you know what to do.
